# Ghi chu: G2 imem map BRAM (dong 'mapping memory ... u_cpu.imem'), G1 khong.
# Nguyen nhan (verified tu log): G1 doc imem o dia chi tu logic to hop pc_new (src/cpu_g1.v:190) → Yosys bao
#   'no address FF found' / 'no output FF found' va chuyen sang 'using FF mapping for memory u_cpu.imem' (log dong 3386, 4112-4116, 4174).
#   G2 doc imem o dia chi tu thanh ghi pc (src/cpu_pipe.v:270) → 'merging output FF to cell' (dong 4211) → BRAM (dong 5022).
# So RAMB36 thu 2 o G2 la imem; G1 khong co RAMB cho imem. Ap dung cho DSE: so o G1 bao gom imem duoi dang FF/LUT (chua tach so).
